TATAYAB is the largest platform specializing in perfumes, bukhour, oud, beauty supplies, skin care, body care and much more!

Now you can shop in a verity of ways for the brands that specialize in your favorite products!

TATAYAB is the largest online platform of its kind in the Middle-East. Get the app with one step to get a fun and unique shopping experience.

You will certainly find what you are looking for from your favorite products with our wide selection of thousands of products and labels that match your choice!

Download the TATAYAB app to get a lot of conveniences such as:

- Get any perfume or fragrance in the world with a few simple steps;
- Get thousands of the best-selling products from perfumes, gifts and accessories;
- Gift your loved ones the best gifts through our gifting services and choose the gift box that matches your taste;
- You can view the products clearly with a magnifying feature;
- The ability to search by ingredient(s);
- Artificial intelligence helps you search for your favorite products
- Machine learning to help refine the search results and arrange them accordingly to suit your taste;
- Save your favorite products to purchase later;
- Liked a product? Share it with anyone on social media;
- Pay with the secure payment method of your choice: cash on delivery, credit/debit card, Apple Pay and through installments;
- Manage your account easily and get exclusive features immediately;
- Enjoy all categories of products (International perfumes, Arabic perfumes, bukhour (incense), oud oils, musk, scents, mubkhars, air fresheners, French perfumes, scented oils, beauty supplies, personal care and many more unique scented goods!);
- Fast shipping to the GCC: Saudi Arabia, Kuwait, Qatar, United Arab Emirate, Bahrain and Oman;
- Shipping to all countries.
